 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 1.28,
   "text": "Later isn't a time."
  },
  {
   "s": 1.78,
   "e": 5.38,
   "text": "When you say you'll do it later, there's nothing in your day that actually says later."
  },
  {
   "s": 5.74,
   "e": 6.92,
   "text": "So it just never comes."
  },
  {
   "s": 7.48,
   "e": 11.36,
   "text": "So give the habit a trigger instead, something you already do every single day."
  },
  {
   "s": 11.78,
   "e": 14.48,
   "text": "And use this sentence, after I do this I will do that."
  },
  {
   "s": 14.8,
   "e": 18.54,
   "text": "Like after I pour my morning coffee, I'll go through 10 Spanish flashcards."
  },
  {
   "s": 19.02,
   "e": 22.32,
   "text": "After I close my laptop for the day, I'll go for 20 minute walk."
  },
  {
   "s": 22.84,
   "e": 25.58,
   "text": "After I finish dinner, I'll read 10 pages of my book."
  },
  {
   "s": 25.58,
   "e": 30.32,
   "text": "So pick the one habit you keep putting off, and attach it to something you already do."
  },
  {
   "s": 30.94,
   "e": 32.74,
   "text": "Then write that sentence down tonight."
  },
  {
   "s": 33.34,
   "e": 37.22,
   "text": "That's what Demure is for, you archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow."
  },
  {
   "s": 37.8,
   "e": 40.52,
   "text": "And break it down into small steps you can actually do."
  },
  {
   "s": 40.94,
   "e": 43.5,
   "text": "If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio."
  }
